###########
## USAGE ##
###########

Launch the program by typing the following in the terminal
python main.py deck.json session_time max_single_time
(warning as of right now main.py doesn't take any arguments)

#############
## DETAILS ##
#############

1) On Linux pygame has a ridiculous bug. It has to
   do with the importing of Font module. You have to
   fix the pygame source manually.

2) The lorem directory contains some test images for ease
   of prototyping and testing.

3) Everytime a session is loaded

4) This script requires to "pip install pygame-ce" (yes the
   community edition because the other is unstable idk why)